flowchart TD
  result[Delivered MCP result] --> reader[Application result reader]
  reader -->|typed application data| update[Surface update]
  layout[Application catalog and layout] --> session[SDK session and Lit surface]
  update -->|valid data| session
  update -->|rejected data| unchanged[Return failure; retain prior surface]
  session -->|initial layout cannot open| fallback[Safe fallback]
  session --> view[Application components and bound actions]
  dispose[Stack disposal] --> retire[Retire bindings and unmount]
  retire --> cleanup[Release session and delivery]
